      "excerpt_preview": "the lyrical values of Ramayana, but as a great devotee-singer said \"Whoever calls you in whatever way, you are that  One\".  Ramayana contains 24,000 verses [sloka]  arranged into numerous cantos [sarga] which are contained in 6 books as  me",
